@ 33.3.1 - Proto-Yokuts to General Yokuts
# citation: CatDoom, from Whistler, Kenneth W., and Golla, Victor (1986), “Proto-Yokuts Reconsidered”. International Journal of American Linguistics Vol. 52, No. 4 (Oct. 1986)
	i:[+ long] ɨ:[+ long] u:[+ long] > e:[+ long] ə:[+ long] o:[+ long] (this change sometimes did not occur)
	e:[+ long] ə:[+ long] > e ə (as a result of ablaut)
	o > u / _Ci